stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> STARTED: POST /orders
    STARTED --> STOCK_RESERVED: StockReserved
    STARTED --> COMPENSATING: StockReservationFailed ou timeout esgotado
    STOCK_RESERVED --> PAYMENT_APPROVED: PaymentApproved
    STOCK_RESERVED --> COMPENSATING: PaymentRejected ou timeout esgotado
    PAYMENT_APPROVED --> COMPLETED: StockCommitted
    COMPENSATING --> COMPENSATED: StockReleased + CancelOrder
    COMPLETED --> [*]
    COMPENSATED --> [*]
    COMPENSATING --> FAILED_MANUAL: compensação esgotou tentativas (DLQ + alerta)
    FAILED_MANUAL --> [*]
